      { t: "find", q: "Find a word in paragraph 2 that means 'treats a weaker person cruelly again and again'.", a: ["bullies", "bully"], x: "bullies = يتنمّر على / يضايق من هو أضعف منه." },
      { t: "find", q: "Find a phrase in paragraph 6 that means 'becomes known' (about a secret).", a: ["comes out"], x: "the secret … comes out = يُكشف السر ويصبح معروفاً." },
      { t: "open", q: "Which character has the strongest influence on Oliver, good or bad? Explain with one detail from the text.", m: "Mr Brownlow has the strongest good influence, because he trusts Oliver and takes him home, which gives Oliver hope for a better future. (Another good answer: Fagin has the strongest bad influence, because he pretends to be a friend while using Oliver.)", x: "الإجابة الجيدة تحدد شخصية، وتصف تأثيرها (إيجابي أو سلبي)، وتدعمه بتفصيل من النص." }
