      "I believe I am a suitable candidate for three reasons. Firstly, I have experience in making short films: last year I produced a three-minute video about the old Hejaz railway station in Amman for my school website. Furthermore, I speak English and French, so I can communicate easily with foreign visitors. In addition, I am a reliable team member, having volunteered as a guide at our school open day for two years.",
      "If I were selected, I would visit each site with an open mind and record the stories of local people. I could then create a video that shows young visitors how to enjoy these places responsibly. As a result, more teenagers might feel proud of our heritage and want to protect it.",
